# SPA fallback: serve the Vite shell for client-side routes.
# Without this, a hard-reload or cold open of /jobs/:id (and other deep
# links) can 404/500 on static preview hosts instead of loading React Router.
# Explicit /jobs/* first — some hosts apply the first match only and treat
# parameterized paths differently from the catch-all.
/jobs/*    /index.html   200
/*         /index.html   200
